WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.070
One click left.

2
00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.770
This opens your Google Form with everything you typed

3
00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.780
already filled in.

4
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.670
Read it over and press Submit —

5
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.590
the moment you do, your work goes straight to Mr. Monell.

6
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:12.270
A copy lands in your school email too, just

7
00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.110
for your records.

8
00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.130
Friday, your packet will be waiting —

9
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.910
all you'll do is sign it.
